<title>USA: Canterbury terminates merger plans.</title>
<headline>Canterbury terminates merger plans.</headline>
<dateline>MEDFORD, N.J. 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Canterbury Information Technology Inc said Friday that through mutual agreement, it had terminated letters of intent to merge with GLTN Computer Consultants Inc, PractiCom Consulting Services and Softec LLC.</p>
<p>Canterbury said it is continuing its acquisition search for information technology companies.</p>
